{"timestamp":"2026-10-13T15:17:53.842Z","ordinal":11792,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0a9cf77de2465950016ace4b9bb5b081999886fd67b7e615c9","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Roy，这次学习异议需要修正的是**伤害的归因**：\n\n原候选的预测差额“少掉 8 血、即时多打 2 伤”仍保留。但原帧显示，执行时先弃掉了“连续反弹”，随后重新询问并改为“迷雾／中和”，后续状态出现了 4 层毒。因此，**整轮实际造成的 20 伤，不能算作原护栏完整候选的实测结果，也不能拿它校准同一条候选路线的模型差额**。\n\n这是对证据适用范围的限定，不否定已核实的局部观察。原提案和护栏保持，后续沿原 `silent-0125` 分列预测与实际执行证据。\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a135d6-6aee-7770-90bb-a79f23dbe52d","create_time":1791904658.43918,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0a9cf77de2465950016ace4b9bb5b081999886fd67b7e615c9","turn_id":"01a135d6-6aee-7770-90bb-a79f23dbe52d","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a135d7-7032-7850-baad-1c568cc8ee43","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":449}}
